   "cap": "BLOOD FLOW | *GOES UP.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "And scientists think the extra oxygen may help keep the tissue healthy.",
   "cap": "SCIENTISTS THINK | THE EXTRA *OXYGEN* | MAY HELP KEEP | THE TISSUE *HEALTHY.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "You often wake up straight out of REM.",
   "cap": "YOU OFTEN WAKE UP | STRAIGHT OUT | OF *REM.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "So you just catch the last one.",
   "cap": "SO YOU JUST CATCH | THE *LAST ONE.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "If they disappear for weeks, talk to a doctor.",
   "cap": "IF THEY DISAPPEAR | FOR WEEKS, | *TALK TO A DOCTOR.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Otherwise, it's not weird.",
   "cap": "OTHERWISE, | IT'S *NOT WEIRD.*",
